ato disilluso a un passo dall'infarto. Grandi sognatori, votati a un più modesto destino, decidono di sequestrare Gerardi e di risarcire coi soldi del riscatto il dolore della vedova di Marghera. Ma niente andrà secondo i piani stabiliti...","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2010-10-22","status":"Released","rating":5.7,"ratingCount":73,"genres":["Commedia"],"countries":["Italy"],"facts":{"Runtime":"102m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":17839,"name":"Pierfrancesco Favino","role":"Pepe","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hedzgTKFKrSleWvLkBlANng8w4T.jpg"},{"id":131683,"name":"Fabio Volo","role":"Toni","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lxgFWQawOvCxH2eg87sjVBG5WkM.jpg"},{"id":7541,"name":"Giuseppe Battiston","role":"Bauer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/22btW2Wybe7CKcI53EcB2uv43sS.jpg"},{"id":126984,"name":"Claudia Pandolfi","role":"Marilù","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lAxrx6HhqEZQcJwHvP4f9iRZaxs.jpg"},{"id":227242,"name":"Paolo Sassanelli","role":"Ramon","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iQNrMG857WG4rpjZrYsXK2RPXr8.jpg"},{"id":224378,"name":"Giorgio Tirabassi","role":"Stella","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o88lUmQ1FEqBRAgdPk833pBAaSa.jpg"},{"id":73873,"name":"Teco Celio","role":"Martino","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5PUIFW0JvgoaLX1ndyJbSeBdQF0.jpg"},{"id":231143,"name":"Fausto Maria Sciarappa","role":"Umberto","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rSZfhF5YKMx09Bs8sHdtzKNzIxC.jpg"},{"id":141830,"name":"Pietro Ragusa","role":"Giampi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3vuTW5ErxDFk1Ur1HcI5u9hEo2u.jpg"},{"id":234814,"name":"Camilla Filippi","role":"Marta","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7XjUNZ0PGoNcaMplaJV82kkk4SO.jpg"},{"id":206409,"name":"Lidia Biondi","role":"Pepe's mother","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2GgxiJsvSBOCqEcnl9tbhOKOtAl.jpg"},{"id":125489,"name":"Edoardo Gabbriellini","role":